<title>SINGAPORE: SOCCER-LEBANON BEAT SINGAPORE 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEBANON BEAT SINGAPORE 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon beat Singapore 2-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in their World Cup Asian zone group seven</p>
<p>qualifying match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Singapore - Steven Tan 58 pen</p>
<p>Lebanon - Abdul Fattah 35, Babkin Melikian 79</p>
<p>    Standings	  P   W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> Kuwait		  2   2   0   0   3   0    6</p>
<p> Lebanon		 3   1   1   1   3   4    4</p>
<p> Singapore	     3   0   1   2   2   4    1</p>
<p>Note: Group winners qualify for the second round</p>
<p>Remaining matches: June 5 Kuwait v Singapore, June 22</p>
<p>Lebanon v Kuwait.</p>
</text>
